Z||000000||MooCow||11-02-2001||12:00 AM||||I havent driving my Fiero in over 2 months since I cracked the tranny.  I had put it up in the shed, but I started it today and o I miss my baby.  I have no clue how to drop the cradle and all that stuff, but can I put the tranny in without dropping the cradle??  If so then I will try it.  Anyone know??  I am pretty sure that I have to drop it and this is my weekend off so I kinda want to work on it.<P>Thanks Ken<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/forum_pic.jpg"> ||||reg||5
